  "fullDescription": "Cute Fruits and Berries Clipart – Kawaii Summer Food SVG Vector Bundle\nAdd a burst of color and pure joy to your designs with our vibrant “Fruits & Berries” collection!\n​Bright, glossy, and full of life, this high-quality vector clip art set is perfect for creating eye-catching children’s projects, summer party decorations, healthy lifestyle branding, and colorful crafts. The collection includes a wide variety of favorite fruits and berries, meticulously designed with smooth gradients, soft reflections.\n​From tropical pineapples and rich watermelons to sweet strawberries and healthy avocados, this versatile pack has everything you need for cheerful, fresh designs.\n​⚠️ ATTENTION FOR DESIGNERS (Clipping Masks Inside):\n​Please note that some premium elements and advanced gradient layouts in the master AI and EPS source files utilize Clipping Masks to maintain perfect geometric proportions, neat highlights, and clean edges.\n​For editing or custom modifications: If you wish to ungroup, recolor, or alter the internal paths of individual fruits (such as the kiwi seeds or watermelon texture), simply right-click the element in Adobe Illustrator or Linearity Curve and select “Release Clipping Mask”.\n​For standard use: The included SVG and PNG files are pre-expanded, merged, and fully ready for immediate digital layout creation or direct printing.\n​What’s Included in this Juicy Pack:\n​A Delicious Variety of Fruits & Berries: Apple, pear, banana, pineapple, kiwi slice, avocado, watermelon slice, orange slice, peach, lemon, orange, and a whole coconut/exotic fruit basket.\n​Sweet Berry Elements: Strawberries (whole and sliced), cherries, blueberries, raspberries, and grapes.\n​24 Unique Elements Total (as indicated by the “24” badge on the preview).\n​Technical Details:\n​Formats: AI, EPS, SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) & PNG (High-Resolution 300 DPI with Transparent Background).\n​Perfect For: Kids’ educational cards, menu designs, summer birthday invitations, sublimation printing (t-shirts, tote bags, aprons, mugs), planner stickers, kitchen decor, and nursery wall art.",
